<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Safeway to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Safeway to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential raised its rating of Safeway Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Safeway said Vons Cos Inc accepted its revised offer to buy the rest of Vons for about $1.56 billion.</p>
</text>
